@startuml
actor Admin
participant "System (Laravel)" as System
participant Twilio
participant "AI Service" as AI
actor Lead

Admin -> System: Request to initiate call
System -> Twilio: Place call to Lead
Twilio -> Lead: Call connects, play greeting (TTS)
Lead -> Twilio: Voice response
Twilio -> System: Send recorded audio
System -> AI: Speech-to-text conversion
AI --> System: Transcribed text
System -> AI: Intent analysis & generate response
AI --> System: AI-generated reply text
System -> Twilio: Play reply (TTS)

loop Conversation
    Lead -> Twilio: Voice reply
    Twilio -> System: Send recorded audio
    System -> AI: Speech-to-text conversion
    AI --> System: Transcribed text
    System -> AI: Intent analysis & generate response
    AI --> System: AI-generated reply text
    System -> Twilio: Play reply (TTS)
end

System -> System: Update lead status (qualified/disqualified)
System --> Admin: Show updated lead status
@enduml
